    "text": "By Kasandra Rattle ,\n16 hours ago The Metropolitan Police Department has made an arrest following an assault in Northwest Washington, D.C. On November 15, at approximately 4:38 p.m., a man was struck with a handgun inside a building on the 1400 block of V Street. According to MPD, the suspect approached the victim, assaulted him with the weapon, and quickly fled the scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
